    "summary": "Painting in water based pigment on printed Italian military paper.Christ is depicted as a sheperd with a lamb round his shoulders and with sheep at his feet. To the right is a male figure with arms crossed in prayer. He wears a shawl (shamma) tucked at the waist.\r\nVerso; divided into three sections,clockwise from left; two men carrying between them a basket slung onto a pole in which a veiled man is being carried. In the foreground are two grazing donkeys; A man defecating; a man vomiting. \r\nPart framed with blue paper mount.",
